      "comment": "MAVERICK (3) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 8 lengths back in second (24.21) at this track in a Grade 6 over 407m. Sure to be about the mark. SPEAKEASY (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Capalaba over 366m behind Thunder Arcade (20.60) in a Grade 6. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. SAY MORE WORDS (4) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Maiden at this track. Can find the frame this time. MITTS WHITAKER (2) is another with top-three prospects.",
